{
  "_comment": "AI Marketing Office team for the Resonance of Indonesia (ROI) Instagram ideation extension, plus a Sales Team and the Motion Graphics & Video Synthesis division for stage visuals. Routing: (1) a file inside a division's folder goes to that division's employee whose keyword is in the file name, else the division's `default`; (2) otherwise the first employee (any division) whose keyword is in the file name; (3) otherwise the employee whose `tools` include the tool (trailing * = wildcard); (4) otherwise `fallback`. `watch` rules highlight file changes in the Activity feed and Manager reports. `chat` controls how the chat panel runs Claude Code.",
  "fallback": "Manager",
  "divisions": [
    {
      "id": "insights",
